<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n37154" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξεράω</span></b> , aor.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξήρᾱσα</span> (v. infr.):—
			Pass.
		, aor.1
		part.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξερᾱθείς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Mul.</u>
					2.121
				</span></i>
			:—<i>evacuate,</i> esp. by <i>purge</i> or
				<i>vomit,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Morb.</u>
				4.49
			</span></i>; <i>draw off</i> a patient's water from the chest,
				ib.<i><span class="en">
				2.61
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <i>to be vomited,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				<u>Eup.</u>
				2.160
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὡς μὴ . . ἐξερῆται</span> that
			(the wound) <i>may</i> not <i>keep on discharging,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>VC</u>
				15
			</span></i> (prob. cj.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>disgorge,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν χύτραν χρῆν ἐξερᾶν τὰ
				&lt;&gt;τεῦτλα</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Crates Com.
				14.8
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μαλάχας ἐ.,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξερυγγάνειν</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Pherecr.
				131.1
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>pour out, let fall,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοὺς λίθους . . χαμᾶζε πρῶτον
					ἐξεράσατε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Ach.</u>
					341
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φέρ᾽ ἐξεράσω [τὰς
			ψήφους</span>] <i>let me pour out</i> the ballots
			<i>from</i> the urn (in order to count them), <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>V.</u>
				993
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξέρα τὸ ὕδωρ</span>
			<i>pour</i> it <i>out,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.
				36.62
			</span></i>, cf.<i><span class="en">
				Aen.Tact.
				31.13
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				2.69
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὥσπερ ἐ. [τὸν ἀέρα</span>]
				<i>drive forth</i> air from the lungs, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				960b26
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Placit.</u>
				4.22.3
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>give out</i> a dye, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PHolm.</u>
				15.37
			</span></i>,al.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅταν δόξῃ ἐξερακέναι τὰ
				φάρμακα</span> ib. <i><span class="en">
				18.16
			</span></i>.—Cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συνεράω</span>: the
			simple <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐράω</span> is not found.</div>
